@startuml update_profile
title Update Profile - UML Sequence Diagram

hide footbox

actor Client
participant UpdateProfileController
participant UpdateProfileHandler
participant TutoringDbContext
database "SQL Server" as Database

Client -> UpdateProfileController : PUT /api/users/me/profile\n(JWT, username/name/phone fields)
UpdateProfileController -> UpdateProfileHandler : Send(UpdateProfileCommand)
UpdateProfileHandler -> TutoringDbContext : Load account by id from JWT sub
TutoringDbContext -> Database : SELECT account
Database --> TutoringDbContext : Row or none

alt account not found
    UpdateProfileHandler --> UpdateProfileController : UserAccountNotFoundException
else account found
    alt username or phone number already used by another account
        UpdateProfileHandler --> UpdateProfileController : UsernameAlreadyTakenException /\nPhoneNumberAlreadyTakenException
        UpdateProfileController --> Client : 409 ProblemDetails
    else data available
        UpdateProfileHandler -> UpdateProfileHandler : Build new PersonalProfile\n(unspecified fields keep current value)
        UpdateProfileHandler -> TutoringDbContext : UpdateProfile() and SaveChangesAsync()
        TutoringDbContext -> Database : UPDATE account and commit
        UpdateProfileHandler --> UpdateProfileController : done
        UpdateProfileController --> Client : 204 No Content
    end
end

@enduml
